## 12. Evidence Observed

The Pass-the-Hash scenario generated evidence on `DC01`.

Observed alert types include:

```text
100011 — NTLM network logon
100021 — special privileges assigned
100030 — DCSync-like activity
100033 — Pass-the-Hash / DCSync correlation
92650  — suspicious service creation
92052  — abnormal command execution
```

The strongest point in the chain is:

```text
100030 + 100021 → 100033
```

because it links DCSync-like credential access with privileged access.

